      "problem": "Expand $(6x + y^2)(6x - y^2) .$",
      "worked_solution": "We will use the difference of square formula:\n\n$$\n(a + b)(a - b) = a^2 - b^2\n$$\n\nSubstituting $a=6x$ and $b=y^2,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\eqalign{\n\t\t(6x + y^2)(6x - y^2) &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t(6x)^2 - \\left(y^2\\right)^2 &= \\[5pt]\n\t\t36x^2 - y^4.\n\t}\n$$",
